    "flavor_text_entries": [
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il rejoint et quitte ce monde en dormant. Son existence se déroule comme un rêve paisible. Il dort du sommeil du juste toute sa vie durant.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It is born asleep, and it dies asleep. All its movements are apparently no more than the results of it tossing and turning in its dreams.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "寝たまま　生まれ　寝たまま　死ぬ。 すべての　行動は　みている 夢に　よる　寝相　らしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "La bûche qu’il tient est un cadeau de naissance de ses parents. S’il est bien apprivoisé, il s’accrochera au bras de son Dresseur.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "The log it holds was given to it by its parents at birth. It has also been known to cling to the arm of a friendly Trainer.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "抱いた　木は　生まれたとき　親から 与えられたもの。　よく　なつけば トレーナーの　腕にも　しがみつく。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il dort continuellement depuis sa naissance. Lorsqu’il est en phase de sommeil profond, il ne bouge plus d’un poil.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It stays asleep from the moment it’s born. When it falls into a deep sleep, it stops moving altogether.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "生まれてから　ずっと　眠ったまま。 深い　眠りに　落ちているときは 一切　動かなくなる。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon passe sa vie entière à dormir à cause des composants anesthésiants qui se trouvent dans les feuilles qu’il mange.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It remains asleep from birth to death as a result of the sedative properties of the leaves that form its diet.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "死ぬまで　ずっと　眠ったままなのは エサの　葉っぱに　麻酔の　ような 成分が　含まれているからだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      }
    ]
